o another, since all the new and reconstructed navigable canals have a uniform depth of 3.65 meters (slightly over 12 feet). This allows 5,000-ton vessels to cruise freely and crisscross the entire Euro\xadpean part of the country, and to sail at will to any of the five seas surrounding the area.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2638, 'temperature': 0.2})
